Strictly speaking, I suppose "depend" is {te
fancu}: "range of values x1 depends on domain of
arguments x2 according to function x3 computed by
formula x4"  The third and fourth places seem
pretty much identical unless the function has a
name ("Bessel functions," say) which does not say
how it is computed.

